; Red control of the closure's scope (D1): the one compiled closure is the package-private library
; effect4_closure of effect4_gen. It installs with effect4_gen, which links it, but an installed
; client names none of its modules, so a value the closure exports to the test lanes stays
; unbound.
; ../../check_install.sh expects this build to fail with the line of red.expected.
(executable
 (name red)
 (libraries effect4_gen.effect4))
